			{ id levelup-faster-consume is equalto value 2 target consumeDays multiplier 0.8 }
			{ id levelup-faster-consume is equalto value 3 target consumeDays multiplier 0.7 }
			{ id levelup-faster-consume is equalto value 4 target consumeDays multiplier 0.65 }
