			{ id levelup-protection is equalto value 2 target consumeDays multiplier 1.02 }
			{ id levelup-protection is equalto value 3 target consumeDays multiplier 1.03 }
			{ id levelup-protection is equalto value 4 target consumeDays multiplier 1.05 }
